   "title": "Problème — Charge d'un condensateur de bus",
   "difficulty": 3,
   "validated": false,
   "params": {
    "R": {
     "unit": "",
     "values": [
      47,
      100,
      220
     ]
    },
    "C": {
     "unit": "F",
     "values": [
      0.001,
      0.0022,
      0.0047
     ]
    },
    "E": {
     "unit": "",
     "values": [
      325,
      540,
      565
     ]
    },
    "k": {
     "unit": "",
     "values": [
      0.8,
      0.9,
      0.95
     ]
    }
   },
   "vars": {
    "tau": "R*C"
   },
   "constraints": [],
   "statement": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "À la mise sous tension d'un variateur, le condensateur de bus $C =$ [[C]] se charge à travers une résistance de précharge $R =$ [[R]] Ω sous une tension $E =$ [[E]] V. La tension $u$ (en V) aux bornes du condensateur vérifie, avec $u(0) = 0$ :"
    },
    {
     "type": "formula",
     "tex": "RC\\,u'(t) + u(t) = E",
     "title": ""
    }
   ],
   "questions": [
    {
     "id": "q1",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Constante de temps τ = RC (s) ?",
     "answer": "tau",
     "unit": "s",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q2",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "La solution est $u(t) = E(1 - e^{-t/\\tau})$. Valeur de $u$ à $t = \\tau$ (V) ?",
     "answer": "E*(1 - exp(-1))",
     "unit": "V",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q3",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Valeur de $u'(0)$ (V/s) ?",
     "answer": "E/tau",
     "unit": "",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q4",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Instant où $u$ atteint [[k]]E : $t = -\\tau\\ln(1 - [[k]])$ (s) ?",
     "answer": "-tau*ln(1 - k)",
     "unit": "s",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q5",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Énergie stockée en fin de charge, $\\frac12 CE^2$ (J) ?",
     "answer": "0.5*C*E^2",
     "unit": "J",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    }
   ],
   "hint": "u'(t) = (E/τ) e^(−t/τ).",
   "method": "1. Identifier τ.\n2. Remplacer t par τ.\n3. Dériver.\n4. Résoudre E(1 − e^(−t/τ)) = kE avec ln.",
   "solution": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "$\\tau = RC \\approx$ [[=tau:3|s]] ; $u(\\tau) = E(1 - e^{-1}) \\approx$ [[=E*(1-exp(-1)):3|V]] ; $u'(0) = E/\\tau \\approx$ [[=E/tau:3]] V/s."
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "$1 - e^{-t/\\tau} = [[k]] \\Rightarrow t = -\\tau\\ln(1 - [[k]]) \\approx$ [[=-tau*ln(1-k):3|s]] ; énergie : [[=0.5*C*E^2:3|J]]."
    }
   ]
  },
