   "title": "Problème — Valeurs moyenne et efficace d'une tension redressée",
   "difficulty": 3,
   "validated": false,
   "params": {
    "V": {
     "unit": "",
     "values": [
      12,
      24,
      230
     ]
    }
   },
   "vars": {
    "Um": "V*sqrt(2)"
   },
   "constraints": [],
   "statement": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "La tension en sortie d'un pont de Graëtz s'écrit $u(t) = U_m|\\sin(\\omega t)|$, de période $\\pi/\\omega$, avec $U_m = [[V]]\\sqrt2$ V. On pose $\\theta = \\omega t$."
    }
   ],
   "questions": [
    {
     "id": "q1",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "$U_m$ (V) ?",
     "answer": "Um",
     "unit": "V",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q2",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta$ ?",
     "answer": "2",
     "unit": "",
     "tolerance": 0.001,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q3",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Valeur moyenne $\\langle u\\rangle = \\dfrac{1}{\\pi}\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}U_m\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta$ (V) ?",
     "answer": "2*Um/pi",
     "unit": "V",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q4",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "$\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$ ?",
     "answer": "0.5",
     "unit": "",
     "tolerance": 0.001,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q5",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Valeur efficace de $u$ (V) ?",
     "answer": "Um/sqrt(2)",
     "unit": "V",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    },
    {
     "id": "q6",
     "kind": "numeric",
     "prompt": "Facteur de forme $U/\\langle u\\rangle$ ?",
     "answer": "pi/(2*sqrt(2))",
     "unit": "",
     "tolerance": 0.01,
     "sig": 3
    }
   ],
   "hint": "sin²θ = (1 − cos 2θ)/2.",
   "method": "Primitive de sin : −cos. Pour la valeur efficace, linéariser sin².",
   "solution": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta = [-\\cos\\theta]_0^\\pi = 2$ ; $\\langle u\\rangle = 2U_m/\\pi \\approx$ [[=2*Um/pi:3|V]]."
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "$\\frac1\\pi\\int_0^\\pi \\sin^2 = \\frac12$ donc $U = U_m/\\sqrt2 = [[V]]$ V ; facteur de forme $\\pi/(2\\sqrt2) \\approx 1{,}11$."
    }
   ]
  },
